      "content": "# ======================\n# Strided Transformer\n# ======================\nnumpy==1.26.4\neinops==0.8.1\ntimm==1.0.15\nmatplotlib==3.7.1\ntqdm==4.66.1\nyacs==0.1.8\nnumba==0.60.0\nfilterpy==1.4.5\nscikit-image==0.25.2\nopencv-python==4.11.0.86\nipython==8.35.0\n\n# ======================\n# Text-to-Motion\n# ======================\ntorch==2.6.0\ntorchvision==0.21.0\nscipy==1.13.1\ntensorflow==2.11.0\nspacy==3.7.2\ntqdm==4.66.1\ntyping_extensions==4.13.2\n\n# ======================\n# Joints2smpl\n# ======================\npandas==2.0.3\ntensorboardx==2.2\ntrimesh==3.9.24\njoblib==1.0.1\nh5py==3.12.1\nchumpy==0.70\nsmplx==0.1.28\n\n# ======================\n# Slowfast\n# ======================\nsklearn==1.6.1\npytorchvideo==0.1.5\n\n# ======================\n# Others\n# ======================\ndotenv==0.9.9\nav==12.1.0\nopenai==1.65.1\nopenpyxl\n\n\n"
